# Placeholder for Images

This folder should contain:
- A main image for the data source page (referenced in the .qmd front matter)
- Any screenshots or diagrams used in the documentation
- Visualizations or example outputs

## Recommended Image Format
- PNG or JPG format
- Main image should be approximately 800x400 pixels for best display
- Name your main image descriptively (e.g., `data-source-logo.png`, `example-map.png`)

## Image Attribution
If using images from external sources, ensure you have permission and provide proper attribution in your documentation.
